{"2811590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ESC (Electronics Security Company)", "steam_appid": 2811590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC (Electronics Security Company)</strong> is a hacking game that challenges players to step into the shoes of an &quot;ethical&quot; hacker. As an infiltrator, you are entrusted with hacking into various computer systems to accomplish  objectives and unveil hidden secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.poster.avif?t=1778756526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.webm?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.mp4?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must strategically navigate through a diverse range of scenarios, each presenting unique challenges and objectives. Work through a variety of missions as you infiltrate systems to unravel hidden secrets and retrieve sensitive information.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6a8c0d5939b3c2f226e2965ad56da85e.poster.avif?t=1778756526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6a8c0d5939b3c2f226e2965ad56da85e.webm?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6a8c0d5939b3c2f226e2965ad56da85e.mp4?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objectives vary from task to task. You can tackle them at your own pace while exploring your own machine and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/03f2c1df9cd37c26acb4e3ddf7142506.poster.avif?t=1778756526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/03f2c1df9cd37c26acb4e3ddf7142506.webm?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/03f2c1df9cd37c26acb4e3ddf7142506.mp4?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your skills as you hack and explore devices,  and uncover the secrets behind ESC.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC (Electronics Security Company)</strong> is a hacking game that challenges players to step into the shoes of an &quot;ethical&quot; hacker. As an infiltrator, you are entrusted with hacking into various computer systems to accomplish  objectives and unveil hidden secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.poster.avif?t=1778756526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/6512e47870c89146f763ac7df26e03b3.webm?t=1778756526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app